<title>USA: Sioux City cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate. Compared with last Monday, slaughter steers and heifers were $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1275-1375 lbs 66.00-67.10.</p>
<p>Select, and a few choice 2-3 1200-1275 lbs 64.85-65.25. Drug</p>
<p>free 1360 lbs 66.50. Select 1-2 1200-1350 lbs 62.50-62.85.</p>
<p>Returning to the feedlot 875-1100 lbs 59.50-62.00; 1225-1250</p>
<p>lbs 56.50-57.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1395 lbs 64.75-65.25.</p>
<p>Drug free 1160 lbs 66.50. Select, and a few choice 1025-1200</p>
<p>lbs 63.00- 64.60. Select 1-2 975-1075 lbs 56.50-59.25.</p>
<p>Returning to the feedlot 925-1185 lbs 55.00-60.00.</p>
</text>
